# Search ad splash header (s3.1.4)

Resume: `@ad-splash$`.

The splash (`#adSplashPage`, `patron-app.js` `showAdSplash`) used to title itself with `getLocation()`, which falls back to `zebbies-garden-washington-dc` when nothing is picked. That is why every Search path said "Zebbies Garden".

## Contract

- `showAdSplash(type, nextFn, options)` — the venue header (club logo + name + venue body) shows **only** when `options.venue === true` **and** a venue is actually picked (`selectedLocationId || pendingDirectLocation`). Club-action buttons (`clubShoutoutBtn`, `reserveTableBtn`, `joinGuestListBtn`, `pay*EntryBtn`) pass `{ venue: true }`.
- Every other path (category tiles, venue search, Mingl) shows `#splashHouseCard`: "Ad Powered by FloqMedia", Contact Us, Facebook & Instagram `@FloqMedia`, `https://www.floqmedia.com`, `mailto:sales@floqmedia.com`, `tel:+18889335677` shown as `+1 (888) WE-FLOQQ`. FLOQR logo stays; the club logo tile is hidden (`.splash-logo-row-single`).
- Paid / packaged campaigns still rotate in `#adCreative` below the header.
- Never fall back to the default location for display copy on the splash.

## Venue-only campaigns

`scoreCampaign(campaign, profile, slot, context)` / `pickCampaign(slot, profile, context)`: a campaign with `venueOnly: true` is served only when `context.locationId === campaign.clubLocationId`. `dc-zebbies-demo` is `venueOnly`. The splash passes the picked venue id only on the venue path.

## i18n

Keys `ad.house.poweredBy`, `ad.house.contactUs`, `ad.house.web`, `ad.house.email`, `ad.house.tel`, `ad.splash.venueBody` in all 11 packs (`scripts/patch-ad-house-i18n.js`). FloqMedia, Facebook, Instagram are brands — not translated.

Tests: `functions/search-ad-house-card.test.js`.
